  "description": "A game no one has ever managed to conquer: Etius.\n\n*\\[GAME OVER\\]*\n\nThe moment every possible strategy had failed…\n\n*“Student Frondier?”*\n\nI became Frondier, a mere extra in the game! Stores and replicates the image of an object. However, the replica is merely an illusion. All I have is the ability to replicate objects as illusions!\n\n*\\[Main Quest: Change of Fate\\]*\n\nYou know the fate that awaits humanity... the day it will meet its end. Save humanity and change its destiny.\n\n*“I’m supposed to change fate with this?!”*\n\nReplicate everything. Forge a new destiny!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
